\item \code{\link[=band]{band()}} and \code{\link[=bands]{bands()}} band any permitted variable.
\item \code{\link[=age]{age()}} and \code{\link[=ages]{ages()}} are shorthand for banding \code{.x}, i.e. \code{.t - .b}.
